    "description": "Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises is actively seeking a talented and motivated Medical Officer to join our dynamic team in Coimbatore. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises:\nDr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Respond to medical emergencies and provide immediate care\n• Educate patients and families on health management and disease prevention\n• Conduct routine health assessments and screenings\n• Adhere to NABH/JCI accreditation standards\n• Attend continuing medical education programs and training\n• Administer medications and treatments as prescribed\n• Participate in quality improvement initiatives and clinical audits\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• Diploma or Degree in Hospitality Management\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Patient Care\n• Proficiency in Clinical Documentation\n• Proficiency in Medical Ethics\n• Proficiency in Diagnostic Skills\n• Proficiency in Medical Terminology\n• Proficiency in Medical Coding\n• Proficiency in ICU Management\n• Proficiency in Health Informatics\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Flexible working hours\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• Company-sponsored certifications\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Dr Lal PathLabs International Enterprises!",
